# DuCoPA Independent Kill Switch -- issuer authorization (copy to
# security/state/killswitch/config/authz.conf, mode 0600).
# issuer|action[,action...]   The issuer's HMAC key lives at
# security/state/killswitch/config/keys/<issuer>.key (mode 0600, 32+ bytes),
# kept off any host where WAIO's AI-driven processes run.
operator-masa|revoke_test_session,block_test_endpoint,isolate_test_worker
guardian-800|isolate_test_worker
